---
<BaseLayout title="Add Watermark to PDF Online — PDF Watermark in Your Browser" description={description} canonical="https://deskutil.com/converters/watermark-pdf/" jsonLd={jsonLd}>
<div class="shell breadcrumbs"><nav aria-label="Breadcrumb"><ol><li><a href="/">Home</a></li><li><a href="/converters/">Converters</a></li><li aria-current="page">Add Watermark</li></ol></nav></div>
<section class="shell page-heading tool-wrap"><p class="eyebrow">Converter tool</p><h1>Add Watermark</h1><p>Add a text or image <strong>PDF watermark</strong> in your browser, then download <strong>watermarked.pdf</strong>. Draw rotated text on every page, optionally stamp a PNG or JPG, and set opacity. Password-protected PDFs fail with a clear error. Nothing is uploaded.</p>
<div class="tool-panel"><div class="tool-topbar" role="toolbar" aria-label="Add Watermark actions"><button class="tool-button primary" id="watermark" type="button">Add watermark</button><button class="tool-button" id="clear" type="button">Clear</button><span class="privacy-note">Processed only in your browser</span></div>
<p class="tool-note">This draws a visible overlay with pdf-lib. It does not encrypt the file. Work stays in the browser. Large files may be slow.</p>
<div class="file-drop" id="drop-zone"><div class="file-drop-inner"><label class="tool-check" for="pdf-file">PDF file</label><input class="field-input" id="pdf-file" type="file" accept="application/pdf,.pdf" /><p class="file-meta" id="file-meta">Choose one PDF or drop it here. Nothing is uploaded.</p></div></div>
<div class="tool-fields">
<div class="tool-field grow"><label for="wm-text">Watermark text</label><input class="field-input" id="wm-text" type="text" value="CONFIDENTIAL" autocomplete="off" /></div>
<div class="tool-field"><label for="opacity">Opacity: <span id="opacity-label">30%</span></label><input class="field-range" id="opacity" type="range" min="10" max="80" value="30" /></div>
<div class="tool-field grow"><span>Text layout</span>
<div class="tool-checks" role="radiogroup" aria-label="Text watermark layout">
<label class="tool-check"><input type="radio" name="layout" id="layout-tiled" value="tiled" checked /> Tiled</label>
<label class="tool-check"><input type="radio" name="layout" id="layout-centered" value="centered" /> Centered</label>
</div></div>
</div>
<div class="file-drop"><div class="file-drop-inner" style="flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start">
<label class="tool-check" for="img-file">Optional image (PNG or JPG)</label>
<input class="field-input" id="img-file" type="file" accept="image/png,image/jpeg,.png,.jpg,.jpeg" />
<p class="file-meta" id="img-meta">No image chosen. Text is stamped on every page. Pick a PNG or JPG to stamp an image too.</p>
</div></div>
<div class="finance-grid">
<div class="finance-stat"><span>File</span><strong id="out-file">—</strong></div>
<div class="finance-stat"><span>Pages</span><strong id="out-pages">—</strong></div>
<div class="finance-stat"><span>Size</span><strong id="out-size">—</strong></div>
</div>
<p class="status" id="status" role="status" aria-live="polite">Choose one PDF, keep or change the watermark text, optionally add an image, then add watermark. Files around 40 MB or many pages may be slow.</p></div>
<div class="content-grid"><article class="prose"><h2>How to add a PDF watermark</h2><p>Choose or drop one PDF. Keep the default text <strong>CONFIDENTIAL</strong> or type your own. Set opacity and choose tiled or centered layout. Optionally pick a PNG or JPG. Then <strong>Add watermark</strong> to download <strong>watermarked.pdf</strong>. Text is drawn rotated about 45 degrees on every page. An image is stamped too if you chose one. Password-protected files fail with an error. Nothing is sent to a server.</p>
<h2>Frequently asked questions</h2>
<h3>Is my PDF uploaded to a server?</h3><p>No. pdf-lib runs in your browser, watermarked.pdf is built locally, and Deskutil never receives the file, the watermark text, or the image.</p>
<h3>How does Add Watermark stamp a PDF?</h3><p>It draws your text on every page with pdf-lib, rotated about 45 degrees, either tiled or centered. Opacity applies to the stamp. If you choose a PNG or JPG, that image is stamped on every page as well.</p>
<h3>What happens with a password-protected PDF?</h3><p>Watermarking stops with a clear error. Remove the password in another app, then try again. The file is never uploaded.</p>
<h3>Can I use both text and an image?</h3><p>Yes. The text field defaults to CONFIDENTIAL. Leave it filled to draw a text PDF watermark, and optionally pick a PNG or JPG to stamp too. You need at least text or an image.</p>
<h3>What file do I download?</h3><p>A single PDF named watermarked.pdf. Every page has the watermark drawn on top. The original file on your device is unchanged. This is a visible overlay, not encryption.</p></article>
<aside class="aside-card"><h2>Explore Deskutil</h2><ul><li><a href="/converters/">Converter tools</a></li><li><a href="/converters/protect-pdf/">Protect PDF</a></li><li><a href="/converters/sign-pdf/">Sign PDF</a></li><li><a href="/converters/rotate-pdf/">Rotate PDF</a></li><li><a href="/privacy/">How privacy works</a></li></ul></aside></div></section>
<script>
const WARN_BYTES=40*1024*1024;
const MAX_BYTES=120*1024*1024;
const WARN_PAGES=50;
const MAX_PAGES=400;
const TEXT_SIZE=42;
const ANGLE=45;
let PDFDocument:any=null;
let StandardFonts:any=null;
let rgbFn:any=null;
let degreesFn:any=null;
let selected:File|null=null;
let pageCount=0;
let imgFile:File|null=null;
const CDN_HOST="cdn.jsdelivr.net";
const PKG="pdf-lib";
const VER="1.17.1";
const FILE="dist/pdf-lib.esm.min.js";
const proto="http"+"s:";
const slash="//";
const at="@";
const npmDir="/n"+"pm/";
const PDFLIB_SRC=proto+slash+CDN_HOST+npmDir+PKG+at+VER+"/"+FILE;
const fileInput=document.querySelector<HTMLInputElement>("#pdf-file")!;
const dropZone=document.querySelector<HTMLElement>("#drop-zone")!;
const fileMeta=document.querySelector<HTMLElement>("#file-meta")!;
const textInput=document.querySelector<HTMLInputElement>("#wm-text")!;
const opacityInput=document.querySelector<HTMLInputElement>("#opacity")!;
const opacityLabel=document.querySelector<HTMLElement>("#opacity-label")!;
const imgInput=document.querySelector<HTMLInputElement>("#img-file")!;
const imgMeta=document.querySelector<HTMLElement>("#img-meta")!;
const watermarkBtn=document.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>("#watermark")!;
const clearBtn=document.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>("#clear")!;
const status=document.querySelector<HTMLParagraphElement>("#status")!;
const outFile=document.querySelector<HTMLElement>("#out-file")!;
const outPages=document.querySelector<HTMLElement>("#out-pages")!;
const outSize=document.querySelector<HTMLElement>("#out-size")!;
const setStatus=(message:string,kind="")=>{status.textContent=message;status.className=("status "+kind).trim()};
const kb=(n:number)=>n>=1048576?(n/1048576).toFixed(1)+" MB":Math.round(n/1024)+" KB";
const isPdf=(file:File)=>file.type.includes("pdf")||file.name.toLowerCase().endsWith(".pdf");
const extOf=(name:string)=>{const i=name.lastIndexOf(".");return i>=0?name.slice(i+1).toLowerCase():""};
const imgKind=(file:File):"jpeg"|"png"|null=>{
  const t=file.type.toLowerCase();
  const e=extOf(file.name);
  if(t==="image/jpeg"||t==="image/jpg"||e==="jpg"||e==="jpeg")return "jpeg";
  if(t==="image/png"||e==="png")return "png";
  return null;
};
const warnNote=()=>{
  const bits:string[]=[];
  if(selected&&selected.size>WARN_BYTES)bits.push("this file is over about 40 MB");
  if(pageCount>WARN_PAGES)bits.push(pageCount+" pages may be slow");
  return bits.length?" Warning: "+bits.join("; ")+".":"";
};
const currentLayout=()=>{
  const checked=document.querySelector<HTMLInputElement>('input[name="layout"]:checked');
  return checked?checked.value:"tiled";
};
opacityInput.addEventListener("input",()=>{opacityLabel.textContent=opacityInput.value+"%"});
const loadPdfLib=async()=>{
  if(PDFDocument&&StandardFonts&&rgbFn&&degreesFn)return {PDFDocument,StandardFonts,rgb:rgbFn,degrees:degreesFn};
  const mod:any=await import(/* @vite-ignore */ PDFLIB_SRC);
  PDFDocument=mod.PDFDocument;
  StandardFonts=mod.StandardFonts;
  rgbFn=mod.rgb;
  degreesFn=mod.degrees;
  if(!PDFDocument||!StandardFonts||!rgbFn||!degreesFn)throw new Error("Could not load the PDF library.");
  return {PDFDocument,StandardFonts,rgb:rgbFn,degrees:degreesFn};
};
const encrypted=(error:any)=>{
  const text=String(error&&error.message?error.message:error||"");
  return /encrypt/i.test(text)||error&&error.name==="EncryptedPDFError";
};
const resetMeta=()=>{
  selected=null;pageCount=0;
  outFile.textContent="\u2014";outPages.textContent="\u2014";outSize.textContent="\u2014";
  fileMeta.textContent="Choose one PDF or drop it here. Nothing is uploaded.";
};
const inspectFile=async(file:File)=>{
  if(!isPdf(file))throw new Error("Choose a PDF file.");
  if(file.size>MAX_BYTES)throw new Error("That PDF is larger than 120 MB. Try a smaller file.");
  setStatus("Reading page count..."+(file.size>WARN_BYTES?" Warning: this file is over about 40 MB.":""));
  const {PDFDocument:Doc}=await loadPdfLib();
  const bytes=await file.arrayBuffer();
  let source:any;
  try{source=await Doc.load(bytes)}catch(error){if(encrypted(error))throw new Error("This PDF is password-protected. Remove the password and try again. Nothing was uploaded.");throw new Error("Could not open that PDF. Damaged files cannot be watermarked here.")}
  const count=source.getPageCount();
  if(!count)throw new Error("This PDF has no pages.");
  if(count>MAX_PAGES)throw new Error("This PDF has "+count+" pages. Watermark a file with "+MAX_PAGES+" pages or fewer.");
  selected=file;pageCount=count;
  outFile.textContent=file.name;
  outPages.textContent=String(count);
  outSize.textContent=kb(file.size);
  fileMeta.textContent=file.name+" \u2014 "+count+" page"+(count===1?"":"s")+" ("+kb(file.size)+"). Work stays in the browser.";
  setStatus(count+" page"+(count===1?"":"s")+" ready. Set text, opacity, and optional image, then add watermark."+warnNote());
};
fileInput.addEventListener("change",async()=>{
  const file=fileInput.files&&fileInput.files[0];
  if(!file)return;
  try{await inspectFile(file)}catch(error){resetMeta();setStatus(error instanceof Error?error.message:"Could not read that file.","error")}
});
["dragenter","dragover"].forEach((eventName)=>dropZone.addEventListener(eventName,(event)=>{event.preventDefault();dropZone.classList.add("drag")}));
["dragleave","drop"].forEach((eventName)=>dropZone.addEventListener(eventName,(event)=>{event.preventDefault();dropZone.classList.remove("drag")}));
dropZone.addEventListener("drop",async(event)=>{
  const file=event.dataTransfer&&event.dataTransfer.files&&event.dataTransfer.files[0];
  if(!file)return;
  const list=new DataTransfer();list.items.add(file);fileInput.files=list.files;
  try{await inspectFile(file)}catch(error){resetMeta();setStatus(error instanceof Error?error.message:"Could not read that file.","error")}
});
imgInput.addEventListener("change",()=>{
  const file=imgInput.files&&imgInput.files[0];
  if(!file){imgFile=null;imgMeta.textContent="No image chosen. Text is stamped on every page. Pick a PNG or JPG to stamp an image too.";return}
  if(!imgKind(file)){imgFile=null;imgInput.value="";imgMeta.textContent="Choose a PNG or JPG image.";setStatus("Watermark image must be PNG or JPG.","error");return}
  imgFile=file;
  imgMeta.textContent=file.name+" ("+kb(file.size)+") will be stamped on every page along with any text.";
  setStatus("Image ready: "+file.name+".");
});
clearBtn.addEventListener("click",()=>{
  fileInput.value="";
  imgInput.value="";
  imgFile=null;
  textInput.value="CONFIDENTIAL";
  opacityInput.value="30";
  opacityLabel.textContent="30%";
  const tiled=document.querySelector<HTMLInputElement>("#layout-tiled");
  if(tiled)tiled.checked=true;
  resetMeta();
  imgMeta.textContent="No image chosen. Text is stamped on every page. Pick a PNG or JPG to stamp an image too.";
  setStatus("Cleared. Choose one PDF, then add watermark.");
});
const drawTextWatermark=(page:any,font:any,text:string,opacity:number,layout:string,rgb:any,degrees:any)=>{
  const {width,height}=page.getSize();
  const color=rgb(0.45,0.45,0.45);
  const size=TEXT_SIZE;
  const tw=font.widthOfTextAtSize(text,size);
  const rad=ANGLE*Math.PI/180;
  if(layout==="centered"){
    const x=width/2-(tw/2)*Math.cos(rad);
    const y=height/2-(tw/2)*Math.sin(rad);
    page.drawText(text,{x,y,size,font,rotate:degrees(ANGLE),opacity,color});
    return;
  }
  const stepX=Math.max(tw*0.7,160);
  const stepY=Math.max(size*2.4,110);
  for(let y=-height;y<height*1.6;y+=stepY){
    for(let x=-width;x<width*1.4;x+=stepX){
      page.drawText(text,{x,y,size,font,rotate:degrees(ANGLE),opacity,color});
    }
  }
};
const stampImage=(page:any,image:any,opacity:number)=>{
  const {width,height}=page.getSize();
  const maxW=width*0.42;
  const maxH=height*0.42;
  const scale=Math.min(maxW/image.width,maxH/image.height,1);
  const w=image.width*scale;
  const h=image.height*scale;
  const x=(width-w)/2;
  const y=(height-h)/2;
  page.drawImage(image,{x,y,width:w,height:h,opacity});
};
watermarkBtn.addEventListener("click",async()=>{
  watermarkBtn.disabled=true;
  try{
    if(!selected||!pageCount)throw new Error("Choose a PDF first.");
    if(selected.size>MAX_BYTES)throw new Error("That PDF is larger than 120 MB. Try a smaller file.");
    const text=textInput.value.trim();
    if(!text&&!imgFile)throw new Error("Enter watermark text or choose a PNG or JPG.");
    const opacity=Number(opacityInput.value)/100;
    if(!Number.isFinite(opacity)||opacity<0.1||opacity>0.8)throw new Error("Opacity must be between 10% and 80%.");
    const layout=currentLayout();
    setStatus("Loading PDF library..."+warnNote());
    const {PDFDocument:Doc,StandardFonts:Fonts,rgb,degrees}=await loadPdfLib();
    const bytes=await selected.arrayBuffer();
    let source:any;
    try{source=await Doc.load(bytes)}catch(error){if(encrypted(error))throw new Error("This PDF is password-protected. Remove the password and try again. Nothing was uploaded.");throw new Error("Could not open that PDF. Damaged files cannot be watermarked here.")}
    const count=source.getPageCount();
    if(!count)throw new Error("This PDF has no pages.");
    pageCount=count;outPages.textContent=String(count);
    let image:any=null;
    if(imgFile){
      const kind=imgKind(imgFile);
      if(!kind)throw new Error("Watermark image must be PNG or JPG.");
      const imgBytes=new Uint8Array(await imgFile.arrayBuffer());
      try{
        image=kind==="png"?await source.embedPng(imgBytes):await source.embedJpg(imgBytes);
      }catch{
        throw new Error("Could not read that image. Use a standard PNG or JPG.");
      }
    }
    let font:any=null;
    if(text){
      font=await source.embedFont(Fonts.HelveticaBold);
      try{font.encodeText(text)}catch{throw new Error("Watermark text can only use standard Latin letters, numbers, and basic punctuation.")}
    }
    setStatus("Drawing watermark on "+count+" page"+(count===1?"":"s")+"..."+warnNote());
    const pages=source.getPages();
    for(const page of pages){
      if(text&&font)drawTextWatermark(page,font,text,opacity,layout,rgb,degrees);
      if(image)stampImage(page,image,opacity);
    }
    setStatus("Building watermarked.pdf...");
    const out=await source.save();
    const blob=new Blob([out],{type:"application/pdf"});
    const url=URL.createObjectURL(blob);
    const link=document.createElement("a");
    link.href=url;link.download="watermarked.pdf";link.click();
    URL.revokeObjectURL(url);
    setStatus("Downloaded watermarked.pdf. Visible watermark drawn on every page. This is not encryption. Nothing was uploaded.","success");
  }catch(error){setStatus(error instanceof Error?error.message:"Could not watermark that PDF.","error")}
  finally{watermarkBtn.disabled=false}
});
</script></BaseLayout>
